  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the Spadille. If you hold the Ace of Spades, you have a 90% chance of winning your first lead. Use it to 'flush' the opponents' trumps early.\n\nHand Evaluation: Only bid 'Solo' if you hold at least two of the three top Matadors and four other trumps. In a 3-player game, card density is high, so a single missing Matador can be fatal.\n\nThe Defensive Pinch: As the two defenders against the Hombre, you must cooperate. If you have the lead and know your partner has no trumps left, lead a suit where the Hombre is likely weak to force them to use a high Matador early.",
    Player: "Prioritize the Spadille. If you hold the Ace of Spades, you have a 90% chance of winning your first lead. Use it to 'flush' the opponents' trumps early.\n\nHand Evaluation: Only bid 'Solo' if you hold at least two of the three top Matadors and four other trumps. In a 3-player game, card density is high, so a single missing Matador can be fatal.\n\nThe Defensive Pinch: As the two defenders against the Hombre, you must cooperate. If you have the lead and know your partner has no trumps left, lead a suit where the Hombre is likely weak to force them to use a high Matador early.",
